		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="17168"></a><b>ErikModi</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Neophyte<br /><img src="images/Ranks/swords/2sword.gif" alt="Neophyte" title="Neophyte" border="0" /><br /><br /><br />Joined: 23 Jan 2003<br />Posts: 54<br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17168&amp;sid=dba1b842c7652a4157933cda01834eb1#17168"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Jan 08, 2004 11:00 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: The status of the Concordat</span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17168&amp;sid=dba1b842c7652a4157933cda01834eb1"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I've noticed of late a deplorable lack of population within the Concordat.  Our guild roster contains many names, but few of them have been on in the last month.  Some have not been online for three or four.
<br />

<br />
Of those who have been, I see few of them personally, and it's always the same names. . . Sarxas, Andolen, Courache, Ceowulf. . . those who have not been on, remain off.
<br />

<br />
So, I start this thread.  What do YOU, the people of the Concordat, think about this, and what might we do to remedy it?  I also ask anyone who is currently a member and wishes to remain so to post here, letting us know if you are simply busy at the moment, and unable to log on, or if you have left the Concordat and/or the game behind.  I would like to "thin out" the member roster within the next few months, if there are no objections.
<br />

<br />
I also wish to start recruiting new members into the Concordat, though I admit I am uncertain how to do so.  If any of you have thoughts on how to do this, or people you would like to have in the Concordat, let me know, and I will attempt to track them down and invite them.
<br />

<br />
Also, I plan on promoting many of the "familiar faces" to officers.  The only officer besides myself I see on anymore is Sarxas, and if there are few/no officers on, the guild cannot recruit new members.  Those of you who are "regulars," you know who you are, and I plan on promoting you next time we're both in game.  If you really don't want to be an officer, that's fine too.
<br />

<br />
Lamaradine entrusted the guild to me, and I feel as though I am failing her.  As though we are failing her.  Let's choose to not fail her, instead, let's choose to make her proud of us.</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
		</table></td>
	</tr>
