		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="17170"></a><b>ArialanaNightingale</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Kerafym<br /><img src="images/Ranks/swords/3sword.gif" alt="Journeyman" title="Journeyman" border="0" /><br /><img src="images/avatars/17177857523f4c3aa1b71c8.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Joined: 02 Sep 2002<br />Posts: 152<br />Location: North Carolina</span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17170&amp;sid=dba1b842c7652a4157933cda01834eb1#17170"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Thu Jan 08, 2004 10:44 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17170&amp;sid=dba1b842c7652a4157933cda01834eb1"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Personally for myself, November through January are ALWAYS very rough and my play time very sparce for EQ. I work in retail, need I say more? I'm a manager in a major retail brand, so work requires much of my time, energy, and devotion since these are the months that we thrive and make the rest of the year.  So no matter the year for as long as I am in retail I will be sparce these months, thats just fact. I log on Llaianya several times a week, either to tradeskill or like last night to level. It's never for an extended amount of time because I just don't have that much time/interest in investing 8 hours into EQ anymore.  Also my favorite character to play is not acceptable to the Concordat ranks, and she is whom I play more than anything, because I garner the most enjoyment of her. &lt;level 55 almost 56 Necromancer of Innoruuk) I have spoken to Ceo and Sarxas within the past week during my outings on EQ and garnered much good conversation. <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" /> So I am around, and will continue to be around but the 7 days a week 8 hours a day that I used to invest days are over...I just don't have that time <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
Insofar as the guild goes, finding hard core roleplaying only people in the EQ of now is going to be hard if not near impossible. I am sure they are out there, but there are so many into power gaming now that I dunno it's lost it's RP'ness along the way. Phat L3wtz and Phat Experience is the wave of EQs future and has been for quite some time, however I think you can still find quite  a few people like myself that just don't give a darn about phat loots or phat experience and just want comfy, cozy, friendly guild.  Just my opinion <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" /><br />_________________<br />Arialana Nightingale
<br />
Healer of the sick, Rezzer of the dead for 50 seasons
<br />
<img src="images/smiles/new_angel.gif" alt="new_angel.gif" border="0" />
<br />
Llaianya Natursangel
<br />
Preserver of the Wild for 59 seasons</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
