		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17171&amp;sid=dba1b842c7652a4157933cda01834eb1#17171"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Fri Jan 09, 2004 10:04 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17171&amp;sid=dba1b842c7652a4157933cda01834eb1"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">*ahems* Excuse me m'lady. But if I may be so bold as to suggest that, the roleplayers are nowhere near gone, but rather are very sparce due to the fact of the "Casual gamer" now a days but like finding an RP on MIRC or something of that nature it's all about where you look and how you approach it.
<br />

<br />
Anyway, M'lady it just dipped to -55 with windchill can I ask you to rez my tail? *The dragon looks at the block of ice attached to his butt.* It seems to be, quite dead.
<br />

<br />
Rithnok Tatsukao Flamespewer</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
