				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hello there!
<br />

<br />
Soo finaly I get my self and my family back to Sweden. First of all, Hope you all had a good end of the year and may the 2004 be as good as it can for all of you! 
<br />

<br />
And for Concordats 2004 I do think we have 3 options? I let all my thougts go here cause in the officers room I belive we are even less to discuss it?   <img src="images/smiles/icon_confused.gif" alt="icon_confused.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
1. to do nothing!
<br />
ok, this is an option just to go on, and we will most probly fade away  since the recruting is so connected with the RP idea. And there are most probly not much newbies on Druzzil Ro any more. The old RP characters are alredy in some guild they like?
<br />

<br />
2. Start to recrute without the RP idea!
<br />
Yea its an option, but probly not that any of us realy whant to. I meen then there are bigger and for thet purpos better guild out there?
<br />

<br />
3. merge the guild into some of our sister guilds!
<br />
could be an option since they also having the same problem as we but not as far gone in the silence as we? Look at A&H and they have the status we had when I joined CA 1,5 years agoo! Thus I do not know what there RP idea lays? Also they do not have the good structure on thier guildwebsite as Q have manage for us! Maby we could have our website and thier name or a new one or what ever and try to be some folk that still help each other (wich A&H alwasy do for me and I for them) and get some RP into scen again? Or is there more guilds out there roleplaying? What about the guild Trystane once get into? wasnt that real good RP that fight for the good of Norrath?
<br />

<br />
Jut talked about option #3 with Arriik last night about it and I think its always ok to talk about things (I hope?). Soo what do you feel about the idea? Or maby I have missed some option for us? Come with suggestion then! Realy think about it! Do we have any decent chance to survive? 
<br />

<br />
P.S  I do know I am not an good roleplayer and that I am talking most of my times ooc those days but I could easly turn into RP mode I belive if the people trigged me! I have had good and fun RP moment with Marchelas, Josephean, Rymer, Flaural and more. And I do miss the moments of bitterness, broken heart and failed love moments with that Druid that rejected me all the time  <img src="images/smiles/icon_biggrin.gif" alt="icon_biggrin.gif" border="0" />  D.S<br />_________________<br />/Sarxas Siaxovog -palladin of his 52th season</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
