at the lvl of 14 i deleted him and started Rymer Moondancer all this was in Brell the old Brell  unfortenly i was deleted from the roster this was january 2002 and Rymer was at an age of 36 got angry deleted him.. I hold up the playing until Sarxas and i talked about restart of Rymer that happend summer 2002 and now Rymer is 51 the new Rymer, But it is hard ) to go solo at this lvl. so i started a lot of new chars and play them rather much. But you know i got tired of all about EQ from time to time. ) Right now Rymer and Jadorm are under the flagg but i would be happy if Tord and Animen also was under our flag in that case CA would be more lively at least 2 more chars in here).
